[1.939, "o", "Investigating: Why did signups fall in the week of 15 July 2026?\r\nDataset: onboarding_regression (synthetic, labelled)  model: claude-sonnet-5  effort: low\r\nThis takes a few minutes. Progress:\r\n"]
